<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Ifo climate index 0800 GMT Friday.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Ifo climate index 0800 GMT Friday.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Ifo economic institute said it would release its September business climate index at 0800 GMT on Friday October 18.</p>
<p>In August, the business climate index rose to 94.4 from 94.0 in July.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
